Keep trying.  Your chance of success increases with your level; the
formula is something like (3 + your level)/(8 + your level).

>: : 	2. I have yet to learn how to make statues do anything at all..?
>: Wield 'em and break open chests

Some also have spellbooks inside them.

>There are sometimes magical statues which can apparently be brought
>to life?  I've had it happen accidentally, but I was wondering if
>you can animate the beasts and make friends with them.

These are statue traps.  If you have the searching intrinsic, sometimes
you'll "find" these traps, with a message like "you find a <monster>
posing as a statue".  Normal statues don't do this.

>: : 	3. How do you convert a unicorn horn?
