>Yeah, I've done it before using nethack 2.3 a number of years ago,
>but I don't remember how anymore.  Getting back into the swing of things
>and enjoying the new thingies in 3.0.

By this do you mean make the horn blessed/cursed?  The same way you do
it for anything else -- (un)holy water.

>: : 	4. What gives the teleport control intrinsic?
>: Tengu
>Hmmm, I thought so.  I thought I ate one, though...  Maybe not.

You don't always get the intrinsic when eating the monster; the chance
depends on the monster's level.  Tengus can also give intrinsic
teleport, which the game checks for before checking for teleport
control.

